00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:20.346
So our agenda for today--

00:00:20.346 --> 00:00:22.220
first off, we're going
to talk about testing,

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.146
what it is, how we
do it, why we do it,

00:00:24.146 --> 00:00:26.020
just kind of as an
explanation of the context

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:29.214
of this presentation.

00:00:29.214 --> 00:00:30.880
Then, we're going to
take that knowledge

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:34.180
and wrap it up in the world
of functions as a service.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:35.680
Third, we're going
to talk about how

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:38.830
to automate this
process using CI/CD,

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:41.897
or continuous integration
